WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:36.343 --> 00:01:39.437
Sasami? Sasami?

00:01:46.686 --> 00:01:48.755
Who's there? Who said that?

00:01:48.755 --> 00:01:51.121
Who called me?

00:01:53.026 --> 00:01:54.721
You're...

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:03.532
Yugi! It's really you, Yugi!

00:02:03.703 --> 00:02:06.035
You remember me.

00:02:07.174 --> 00:02:11.111
Of course! I could never forget you!

00:02:11.111 --> 00:02:16.383
Sasami, when the full moon
rises in the east tomorrow,

00:02:16.383 --> 00:02:19.619
come to the lake in the
mountains behind your house.

00:02:19.619 --> 00:02:21.955
The lake in the mountains behind the house?

00:02:21.955 --> 00:02:23.623
Sure, I'll be there!

00:02:23.623 --> 00:02:25.525
Can I bring Ryo-Ohki with me?

00:02:25.525 --> 00:02:29.518
Sure. But make sure
you come. I'll see you there.

00:02:38.271 --> 00:02:40.607
What kind of dream were you having?

00:02:40.607 --> 00:02:44.744
I was saying hello to a friend.
I said I'd come over tomorrow to play.

00:02:44.744 --> 00:02:46.413
So you're finally going to...

00:02:46.413 --> 00:02:51.885
The ties holding that family
together have become brittle.

00:02:51.885 --> 00:02:55.548
I'm going to smash those ties. Personally.

00:03:15.842 --> 00:03:18.778
You think I'm in a good mood today?

00:03:18.778 --> 00:03:21.269
You know why, Ryo-Ohki?

00:03:22.716 --> 00:03:27.483
The truth is, I saw a friend
of mine in a dream last night.

00:03:32.058 --> 00:03:35.653
The lake in the mountains
behind the house, huh?

00:03:42.702 --> 00:03:44.465
Come on!

00:03:48.608 --> 00:03:49.609
Point!

00:03:49.609 --> 00:03:51.578
Tenchi's awesome!

00:03:51.578 --> 00:03:54.381
They sure grow 'em strong
out in the boonies these days!

00:03:54.381 --> 00:03:56.616
Hey, Masaki!

00:03:56.616 --> 00:03:58.243
Come on, Sakuya!

00:04:01.621 --> 00:04:02.883
Cut it out!

00:04:05.425 --> 00:04:09.429
This is kinda nice... Thanks, Dad.

00:04:09.429 --> 00:04:12.933
Our Tenchi, in full bloom of youth...

00:04:12.933 --> 00:04:16.136
Come on! The loser springs for a youthful lunch!

00:04:16.136 --> 00:04:17.865
What're you talking about?!

00:04:25.145 --> 00:04:27.547
Go for it, Tenchi, my boy...

00:04:27.547 --> 00:04:30.650
Youth is the springtime of life,
and it only comes around once.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.752
Sing the praises of this world's spring purely,

00:04:32.752 --> 00:04:35.822
properly, and beautifully
with the one you love.

00:04:35.822 --> 00:04:38.620
That's your father's wish.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:45.297
And the best part is, she
doesn't fly or shoot out light beams!

00:04:52.839 --> 00:04:56.673
Here! Comes! Ryo! Ko!

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:02.115
I just can't put any
effort into anything lately...

00:05:02.115 --> 00:05:04.517
I guess it's because Tenchi isn't here.

00:05:04.517 --> 00:05:06.820
We can see each other
whenever we want, but still...

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.255
Oh, a woman in love is a beautiful thing!

00:05:09.255 --> 00:05:17.597
Come back for me soon, Tenchi!

00:05:17.597 --> 00:05:19.497
Oh, right!

00:05:26.573 --> 00:05:30.343
I wonder what he's up to right now?

00:05:30.343 --> 00:05:34.047
So that man is what
makes your face light up.

00:05:34.047 --> 00:05:35.947
Who's there?

00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:47.827
What's your name?

00:05:47.827 --> 00:05:50.563
Ryoko. What's yours?

00:05:50.563 --> 00:05:51.965
Hotsuma.

00:05:51.965 --> 00:05:55.402
I like you. Come here again.

00:05:55.402 --> 00:05:58.303
Then we'll finish this for real.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.308
Hotsuma...

00:06:02.308 --> 00:06:05.779
You remember me. I'm honored.

00:06:05.779 --> 00:06:07.804
How could I forget?!

00:06:11.718 --> 00:06:13.687
Ryoko's up to something again...

00:06:13.687 --> 00:06:16.087
Oh, forget about her. Let's go, Ryo-Ohki.

00:06:19.793 --> 00:06:23.329
Nobody lays a hand on my
Tenchi and gets away with it!

00:06:23.329 --> 00:06:26.332
You misunderstand me.
I didn't come here to fight you.

00:06:26.332 --> 00:06:30.036
Shut up! It's pretty obvious
that you're no ordinary human!

00:06:30.036 --> 00:06:33.740
You've no room to talk, space pirate Ryoko.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.207
What?!

00:06:38.411 --> 00:06:41.448
Who the hell are you, you bastard?

00:06:41.448 --> 00:06:45.185
Let's just say I'm a kindred spirit.

00:06:45.185 --> 00:06:49.222
Look, I'm sorry. I won't
lay a hand on that boy again.

00:06:49.222 --> 00:06:52.859
That was just a little game.
A show of jealousy on my part.

00:06:52.859 --> 00:06:56.262
Jealousy? What do you mean?

00:06:56.262 --> 00:07:02.001
I want to do all I can to
make you happier than he can.

00:07:02.001 --> 00:07:03.559
Huh?

00:07:08.608 --> 00:07:11.941
What, you've got the hots for me?

00:07:14.314 --> 00:07:16.416
Oh, I get it...

00:07:16.416 --> 00:07:19.486
A fight between two men for
the most beautiful girl in the world!

00:07:19.486 --> 00:07:24.390
I'm such a bad girl!

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:28.962
But you should give up.
From head to toe, I'm Tenchi's.

00:07:28.962 --> 00:07:33.700
If you want a girlfriend, I can
introduce you to a hog named Ayeka.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.869
Go home.

00:07:35.869 --> 00:07:38.071
Something has happened to Tenchi.

00:07:38.071 --> 00:07:39.873
Something's happened?

00:07:39.873 --> 00:07:42.175
I came here today to tell you that.

00:07:42.175 --> 00:07:43.938
Hey!

00:07:49.015 --> 00:07:51.483
Something's happened to Tenchi?

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.432
The wind is howling and the
clouds are stained blood-red...

00:08:06.432 --> 00:08:08.832
Something is about to happen.

00:08:15.842 --> 00:08:17.777
Mr. Masaki!

00:08:17.777 --> 00:08:19.746
What the hell were you thinking?!

00:08:19.746 --> 00:08:22.882
How could you approve of such
an impure association with that girl!

00:08:22.882 --> 00:08:27.020
That's so mean, Mr. Masaki! How could
you do such a thing behind our backs?!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.488
Well planned, Nobuyuki.

00:08:33.893 --> 00:08:35.695
Oh, this is bad! Really bad!

00:08:35.695 --> 00:08:41.734
Right now, my Tenchi and that
bitch might be doing this... or this!

00:08:41.734 --> 00:08:43.269
No, not Tenchi!

00:08:43.269 --> 00:08:45.705
No, Tenchi's a man.

00:08:45.705 --> 00:08:47.574
If she were to use her feminine wiles...

00:08:47.574 --> 00:08:48.942
They're doing it!

00:08:48.942 --> 00:08:52.139
I knew it! Those two are doing it!

00:08:55.348 --> 00:09:00.720
Oops. The Dimension Tunnel's closed.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.816
Forget about it. You can't come here.

00:09:05.892 --> 00:09:08.928
Gimme some money, Mr. Masaki!
I'll buy a bullet train ticket!

00:09:08.928 --> 00:09:11.664
Make something! Make a machine
that'll fly there in three seconds!

00:09:11.664 --> 00:09:14.500
- Gimme money! Come on!
- Make something! Make something!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.866
I'll just cry for now.

00:09:18.238 --> 00:09:19.973
What a racket...

00:09:19.973 --> 00:09:22.601
Gimme some money!

00:09:35.855 --> 00:09:37.846
Wh-What in the world?

00:09:40.059 --> 00:09:42.755
Wait! Don't go outside!

00:09:55.842 --> 00:09:58.208
I guess Yugi's not coming...

00:09:59.412 --> 00:10:02.006
Well, it was only a dream...

00:10:12.892 --> 00:10:15.258
Maybe we should go back, Ryo-Ohki.

00:10:25.204 --> 00:10:26.773
What in the world?

00:10:26.773 --> 00:10:28.541
Grandpa Masaki, what are these?

00:10:28.541 --> 00:10:30.202
I don't know.

00:10:31.411 --> 00:10:33.242
Look! Look!

00:10:38.751 --> 00:10:40.514
Yugi!

00:10:43.723 --> 00:10:46.521
So you came, Sasami.

00:10:58.471 --> 00:11:00.673
Come on, Masaki! It's this way!

00:11:00.673 --> 00:11:03.109
The restaurant's right over here!

00:11:03.109 --> 00:11:06.772
Okay, okay! You don't have to drag me!

00:11:12.452 --> 00:11:14.754
I am Yugi,

00:11:14.754 --> 00:11:18.157
the new ruler of this world.

00:11:18.157 --> 00:11:20.560
You rabble of the Masaki family...

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:26.466
Offer up your lives for a greater purpose!

00:11:26.466 --> 00:11:28.501
What an evil aura!

00:11:28.501 --> 00:11:30.536
"Ruler"?

00:11:30.536 --> 00:11:32.705
Look here, Yugi or whatever your name is...

00:11:32.705 --> 00:11:37.443
Didn't your mama teach you to be
polite when you talk to beautiful ladies?!

00:11:37.443 --> 00:11:40.105
Begone, rabble...

00:11:42.648 --> 00:11:46.452
A young lady from Bizen got married,

00:11:46.452 --> 00:11:50.390
and on her head was her bridal hood.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:54.460
But you can't put those on a cow's horns.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:57.897
The oxcart plodded along
outside the rice field footpaths,

00:11:57.897 --> 00:12:01.901
and now her gold embroidery
is all covered in mud.

00:12:01.901 --> 00:12:04.062
Her silver trim is all scuffed...

00:12:04.837 --> 00:12:06.472
Ow...

00:12:06.472 --> 00:12:08.474
Are you okay, Yugi?

00:12:08.474 --> 00:12:10.376
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:12:10.376 --> 00:12:12.037
That's okay!

00:12:21.687 --> 00:12:25.858
What is she? What is she?
What is that little kid?!

00:12:25.858 --> 00:12:29.595
Did you steal candy from some baby again?!

00:12:29.595 --> 00:12:32.758
I didn't steal any candy! Not lately!

00:12:37.804 --> 00:12:39.567
Look out!

00:12:41.474 --> 00:12:42.475
Kamidake!

00:12:42.475 --> 00:12:46.579
Not to worry, Princess.
You aren't injured, are you?

00:12:46.579 --> 00:12:48.843
No. Thank you.

00:12:50.983 --> 00:12:53.553
Damn... What power!

00:12:53.553 --> 00:12:55.054
Katsuhito!

00:12:55.054 --> 00:12:56.756
Such horrible power...

00:12:56.756 --> 00:12:58.524
If we combined all our
power, we could probably

00:12:58.524 --> 00:13:00.693
take her with us when
we die if we were lucky.

00:13:00.693 --> 00:13:02.562
But if we weren't lucky...

00:13:02.562 --> 00:13:03.663
Damn it!

00:13:03.663 --> 00:13:07.394
Running won't help you.
I never lose at hide and seek.

00:13:14.507 --> 00:13:17.743
You think this kid stuff can kill me?!

00:13:17.743 --> 00:13:19.711
What a laugh!

00:13:21.481 --> 00:13:22.615
Ladder!

00:13:22.615 --> 00:13:24.050
Tokyo Tower!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:26.452
Arch bridge!

00:13:26.452 --> 00:13:29.522
See? You go like this,
and this, and then this...

00:13:29.522 --> 00:13:31.285
Got it?

00:13:33.593 --> 00:13:38.030
You do this to this, and pull it through here...

00:13:40.933 --> 00:13:41.968
I did it!

00:13:41.968 --> 00:13:45.062
Yeah, just like that! Great job, Yugi!

00:13:46.205 --> 00:13:49.442
This one's called "cat's cradle."

00:13:49.442 --> 00:13:52.411
Grandpa Katsuhito taught me.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.349
Sasami, are you having fun?

00:13:56.349 --> 00:13:58.751
Huh? Sure, I'm having a great time!

00:13:58.751 --> 00:14:02.288
Because you came to see me!

00:14:02.288 --> 00:14:04.222
How about you, Yugi?

00:14:05.525 --> 00:14:07.550
I'm having fun.

00:14:09.228 --> 00:14:11.197
Hey, wanna go pick flowers?

00:14:11.197 --> 00:14:12.265
Pick flowers?

00:14:12.265 --> 00:14:14.567
Yeah! Let's make flower necklaces!

00:14:14.567 --> 00:14:15.334
Okay.

00:14:15.334 --> 00:14:16.335
Great!

00:14:16.335 --> 00:14:18.200
This way! This way!

00:14:36.556 --> 00:14:39.125
You dare make me involve myself in this?

00:14:39.125 --> 00:14:41.218
Allow me to reward you.

00:14:50.503 --> 00:14:51.304
Huh?

00:14:51.304 --> 00:14:53.806
What is it, Masaki?

00:14:53.806 --> 00:14:56.008
Uh... It's nothing.

00:14:56.008 --> 00:15:00.240
So what were you saying
about Yoshinaga and Kanno?

00:15:01.547 --> 00:15:02.915
Well, I was saying...

00:15:02.915 --> 00:15:07.320
They're always badgering me!
They keep asking me if I like you.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:10.489
I'm sorry. I won't be too obvious about it.

00:15:10.489 --> 00:15:13.292
I know you hate that.

00:15:13.292 --> 00:15:17.626
I don't hate it...
You don't have to be so careful.

00:15:25.404 --> 00:15:28.307
Child's play...

00:15:28.307 --> 00:15:31.177
This is what happens when the bonds
that hold you together slack even once...

00:15:31.177 --> 00:15:33.579
There was no need for me to show myself...

00:15:33.579 --> 00:15:39.279
Impossible... How could
I be taken out so easily?

00:15:43.055 --> 00:15:45.224
Now, to finish this.

00:15:45.224 --> 00:15:47.317
Tenchi...

00:15:55.701 --> 00:15:57.965
Masaki?

00:16:12.685 --> 00:16:14.676
Tenchi...

00:16:15.655 --> 00:16:17.919
Lord Tenchi...

00:16:19.592 --> 00:16:21.494
It's...

00:16:21.494 --> 00:16:23.587
Tenchi...

00:16:25.164 --> 00:16:27.394
Tenchi...

00:16:36.909 --> 00:16:39.810
They still have that much power?

00:16:42.682 --> 00:16:44.582
Yugi!

00:16:48.187 --> 00:16:51.891
What's wrong, Yugi?! Yugi!

00:16:51.891 --> 00:16:55.261
I'm... all right. It's nothing.

00:16:55.261 --> 00:16:59.198
Yugi! Yugi! Hang on!

00:16:59.198 --> 00:17:03.294
I've been in this world for too long.

00:17:05.304 --> 00:17:10.833
You little pipsqueak! Don't mess with Ryoko!

00:17:24.924 --> 00:17:27.552
Damn...

00:17:31.831 --> 00:17:35.528
"Ryoko." I'll remember that name.

00:17:48.414 --> 00:17:49.882
You!

00:17:49.882 --> 00:17:53.185
I see you're still the same as ever, Ryoko.

00:17:53.185 --> 00:17:56.814
We're here now, so you can relax.

00:17:58.524 --> 00:18:03.396
So it's come to this, has it?
I have no choice, then.

00:18:03.396 --> 00:18:06.388
I'll grant you a stay of execution.

00:18:22.014 --> 00:18:24.350
Ryoko.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.252
We'll meet again.

00:18:26.252 --> 00:18:28.117
'Bye!

00:18:29.622 --> 00:18:32.425
They... What the heck just happened?

00:18:32.425 --> 00:18:34.627
Katsuhito! What in the world?

00:18:34.627 --> 00:18:40.166
I don't know. But someone is trying
to involve us in some horrible, vast plot.

00:18:40.166 --> 00:18:43.329
A plot?

00:18:58.851 --> 00:19:00.944
Yugi?

00:19:03.756 --> 00:19:05.849
Yugi?

00:19:06.959 --> 00:19:11.497
What, I dreamt it all? Great!

00:19:11.497 --> 00:19:13.999
Ryo-Ohki! Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:13.999 --> 00:19:15.728
Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:21.674 --> 00:19:23.403
Let's go home!

00:19:44.263 --> 00:19:46.629
Um, the phone's ringing...

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.536
I'm beat...

00:19:50.536 --> 00:19:52.197
Quiet down!

00:19:55.207 --> 00:19:57.539
What the heck?

00:20:20.733 --> 00:20:22.835
Maybe I moved too soon.

00:20:22.835 --> 00:20:25.204
Those people are pretty tough.

00:20:25.204 --> 00:20:27.106
It's because you aren't going all-out.

00:20:27.106 --> 00:20:30.643
If you hadn't been split
in two, you could've won.

00:20:30.643 --> 00:20:33.479
I suppose. But I didn't want her to see.

00:20:33.479 --> 00:20:35.214
She's my friend.

00:20:35.214 --> 00:20:40.379
Still, those two earned Ryoko's
trust, so let's consider it a victory.

00:20:46.892 --> 00:20:49.224
We'll take our time.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:57.601
I had fun, Sasami.

00:21:36.709 --> 00:21:40.312
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:40.312 --> 00:21:44.216
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:44.216 --> 00:21:47.820
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:51.757
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.757 --> 00:21:55.260
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:59.231
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:59.231 --> 00:22:02.568
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.568 --> 00:22:06.572
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.572 --> 00:22:08.707
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.707 --> 00:22:10.643
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.643 --> 00:22:12.144
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:12.144 --> 00:22:17.983
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.983 --> 00:22:22.087
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:22.087 --> 00:22:25.357
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:25.357 --> 00:22:28.894
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.894 --> 00:22:33.593
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:44.576 --> 00:22:45.611
Ayeka here!

00:22:45.611 --> 00:22:49.148
Even without the
Dimension Tunnel or train fare,

00:22:49.148 --> 00:22:53.485
I, Ayeka, will walk to see
my Lord Tenchi if I have to!

00:22:53.485 --> 00:22:57.489
All young ladies who search for
love and believe in love feel the same!

00:22:57.489 --> 00:23:00.726
What? You'll take me
with you to Tokyo for free?!

00:23:00.726 --> 00:23:05.531
Masayo! Let's fly off together
in pursuit of the men we love!

00:23:05.531 --> 00:23:11.163
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Tokyo or Bust!"
